# Per-session hook state written by .claude/hooks/gate-evidence.mjs. Local and disposable —
# it records which validation gates were observed green in the current session.
#
# A nested .gitignore is used deliberately rather than editing the root one: the root .gitignore
# is an upstream file, so a line there would be merge debt against ASLS-org/studio for a purely
# local artefact. New files are free (CLAUDE.md §2).
.gate-state.json
